{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304100","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530410001:1":{"text":"영지에서 전사들이 돌아오기를 기다리고 있단다.","source_cn":"我在等营地里的战士们回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212F04E0219C3E71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530410002:1":{"text":"다들 사냥이나 순찰을 나가서, 이 늙은이 혼자 남아 영지를 지키고 있지.","source_cn":"他们要么出去捕猎，要么出去巡逻，只留我这个老家伙在营地里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECFE85D3CEB7483","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530410003:1":{"text":"사냥의 신전 쪽에 별다른 일이 없었으면 좋겠는데.","source_cn":"只希望狩猎神殿那边别出什么事情才好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x626EB3099A94CC46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:麻果":{"text":"일리마","source":"麻果","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}